    {
      "name": "ChatThread",
      "note": "A short thread: the \"does chat hang together\" check — a user turn (softer `accentSubtle` bubble on the right, with a hover Copy) and a bubbleless assistant turn (avatar + plain prose + Copy / Read aloud / context-usage readout), then the composer. Only the user's own message rides a bubble; the assistant turn flows as plain prose in the reading column (#1459). In-app the user bubble binds `ChatUserBrush` (accent at low opacity) with `ChatUserTextBrush`, and the footer follows the refreshed model and reasoning-effort pickers. Thread max-width 768px and the user bubble cap 720px are Reactor port notes.",
      "root": {
        "id": "chat-thread-root",
        "el": "div",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "vertical",
          "gap": "3",
          "width": "fill"
